              "insert": "Overall, [Count_of_Rows] of scam victims were located in [Account_BillingState] the most in the month. The top 3 scam types were {{cell(Type_2.result, 0, \"Type\").asString()}}, {{cell(Type_2.result, 1, \"Type\").asString()}}, {{cell(Type_2.result, 2, \"Type\").asString()}} which represented a combined total of [Percent]% of all scam cases worked."
            },
            { "attributes": { "align": "left" }, "insert": "\n" }
          ],
          "values": {
            "Percent": {
